    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct cred: task credentials",
      "source_hash": 10458882129797922313,
      "context_hash": 12379163363399942913,
      "translation": "struct cred: 태스크 자격 증명",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:29.938512Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Every task has a `struct cred` that holds its security identity:",
      "source_hash": 540289787857395170,
      "context_hash": 1369253540365760215,
      "translation": "모든 태스크에는 보안 정체성을 담는 `struct cred`가 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:29.938512Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Credential immutability",
      "source_hash": 5487382906582592346,
      "context_hash": 11280982618516386615,
      "translation": "자격 증명의 불변성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:29.938512Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Credentials are **copy-on-write**: to modify credentials, you prepare a new copy, modify it, then commit:",
      "source_hash": 7221199641176012530,
      "context_hash": 3898233632094486440,
      "translation": "자격 증명은 **copy-on-write** 방식입니다. 자격 증명을 수정하려면 새 사본을 준비하고, 그 사본을 수정한 다음 커밋합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "copy-on-write": "copy-on-write"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:29.938512Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "The credential transition on execve",
      "source_hash": 2462867671198943469,
      "context_hash": 2797456119683431075,
      "translation": "execve 시의 자격 증명 전환",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:29.938512Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "User namespaces",
      "source_hash": 4954884133910661021,
      "context_hash": 1240643202126926843,
      "translation": "사용자 네임스페이스",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "user namespace": "사용자 네임스페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:33:35.836427Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A **user namespace** creates a private mapping between UIDs/GIDs in the namespace and the host system.",
      "source_hash": 10735937869159193171,
      "context_hash": 4882751967321223040,
      "translation": "**사용자 네임스페이스**는 네임스페이스 안의 UID/GID와 호스트 시스템 사이에 독립적인 매핑을 만듭니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "GID": "GID",
        "UID": "UID",
        "host": "호스트",
        "namespace": "네임스페이스",
        "user namespace": "사용자 네임스페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:33:35.836428Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This allows:",
      "source_hash": 1291712171285483926,
      "context_hash": 10902154511783573172,
      "translation": "이를 통해 다음이 가능합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:29.938513Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
