      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When the kernel resolves UIDs for permission checks, it always works with **k**uids (kernel UIDs) that map to the initial user namespace:",
      "source_hash": 11693388011206725131,
      "context_hash": 12382174360215072859,
      "translation": "커널이 권한 검사를 위해 UID를 해석할 때는 항상 초기 사용자 네임스페이스에 매핑되는 **k**uid(커널 UID)를 사용합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "UID": "UID",
        "user namespace": "사용자 네임스페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:33:35.836429Z",
      "issues": []
    },
